WEBVTT

00:06:57.996 --> 00:07:01.916
So the LEAF model promises
better outcomes for forests,

00:07:01.956 --> 00:07:04.316
better outcomes for the people
who live there

00:07:04.356 --> 00:07:07.316
and better outcomes
for the forest nations as a whole.

00:07:08.076 --> 00:07:10.876
But you may be asking,
what's in it for the companies?

00:07:11.396 --> 00:07:13.876
Well, now more than ever,

00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:17.436
companies see a business case
for climate action.

00:07:17.476 --> 00:07:19.676
Their customers are demanding it,

00:07:19.716 --> 00:07:21.076
their investors are,

00:07:21.076 --> 00:07:22.756
so are their employees.

00:07:23.356 --> 00:07:27.476
And companies recognize
that truly leading on climate

00:07:27.476 --> 00:07:29.156
means doing two things.

00:07:29.516 --> 00:07:34.956
First, reducing emissions in their own
operations and supply chains.